WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.600
Lunchtime!

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.680
Carrot porridge is on today's menu!

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.450
Her baby teeth are growing in,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.490
so she should be ready to eat solid foods instead of just milk.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.960
And then...

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.200
we'll make some fruit punch to go with it!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.110
Stirry, stirry, stirry!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.260
The Lovely Pad can do that as well?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.060
It <i>is</i> a magic pad!

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.500
Here comes the airplane!

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.370
Let's try that again.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.260
Now, say "aah."

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.730
She won't eat it.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.830
Seems she's not a fan of carrots.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.790
That won't do, Ai!

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.540
Picky eaters can't become proper ladies.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:16.660
Mayhap you might enjoy my carrots instead?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.720
Ai's still a bit young for curry.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:26.000
T'was simply a joke, of course!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.840
Aguri, do you...

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.540
D-Do I what?

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.340
Are you avoiding...

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.310
your carrots?

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:35.010
{OP}

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:41.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.550
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.590
Every day it sparkles

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:59.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:15.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:21.620
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:30.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.080
is our promise between girls

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:50.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:56.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.230
I can't believe it!

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.670
Aguri's a picky eater?

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.450
You love sweets...

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:10.640
And hate carrots...

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:13.300
A textbook spoiled girl!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.150
Well, I'm still in elementary school...

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.210
What don't you like about carrots?

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.180
Positively everything!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.700
The odor!

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.890
That unspeakable flavor!

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.590
Carrot... no-no!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:28.790
Ai?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.990
It seems Ai has adopted your distaste for carrots.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:36.860
No-no!

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.150
What kind of mother sets a poor example for her child?

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:45.910
That's what you told me when I had that cavity.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.410
If you won't eat your carrots,

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.010
then Ai won't eat hers, either.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:54.490
Wouldn't you say it's your turn to set a good example?

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.020
It <i>is</i> for Ai...

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.770
I understand.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:07.530
I shall overcome my loathing of carrots!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:15.030
No More Picky Eating!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:15.030
No More Picky Eating!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:17.910
Now then...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.800
"Aaah!"

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.350
I simply can't!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.600
What should we do?

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.420
This...

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.760
calls for dietary education.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.270
Education?

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.630
Is that clear?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.970
Carrots are beta-carotene vegetables rich in nutrients.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.670
They contain an enormous amount of carotene.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:54.550
Carotene strengthens the immune system, which protects us from disease.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:59.070
In addition, the body converts carotene into vitamin A.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.260
Vitamin A gives us healthy skin—

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.510
Stooooooop!

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.460
Nobody wants a boring lecture!

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.520
Hey Aguri, carrots are healthy!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.990
Wh-What monstrosity are you?!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.310
I'm the carrot fairy, Carrot!

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.300
More like Mana.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.480
I came to make you see the wonders of carrots!

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.140
Now, Aguri...

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.470
Noooo!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.510
Aguriiiii!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:36.470
I'm appalled that I can't conquer even a single carrot!

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.780
They may be the greatest enemies I've faced yet!

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.260
Another plate, if you'd please!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.890
Enemies, huh?

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:50.570
You sure can binge on those cakes, though.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:55.700
Even I'm ashamed of my own limits.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:58.640
How can I still call myself a Precure?

00:05:58.640 --> 00:05:59.710
Aguri...

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:03.680
Being a picky eater is cute in its own, childlike way.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.310
Nevertheless, we can't let this continue.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:12.100
It's not just your problem alone, Aguri.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.030
What should we do?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.150
Carrot!

