00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.070
Grandpa!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.180
Who's the person in this photo?

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:30.670
That's the farmer that owns the Pig's Tail and stocks our carrots.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:36.270
He put this here so customers could see the guy who grew their carrots.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:39.070
A bit of an oddball, huh?

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.580
That's it!

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.020
Dinner is served!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.050
And this is?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.930
My secret recipe!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.320
Ugh, veggies?

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.780
I didn't make it for you!

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.260
Now, aren't I <i>such</i> a good henchman?

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:01.200
So how about taking this ring off?

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.060
<i>That's</i> your game?

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.180
Mammo.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.080
What was <i>that</i> for?!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.750
I... hate carrots.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:20.440
If you want to brown-nose,

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.560
you'd do better to defeat those bothersome Precures.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.700
Right, Ira?

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.690
Fine, I'm goin'.

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:38.050
Where in the world are you taking us?

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.070
We're almost there.

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:41.670
I'm humbled that you asked me to join.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:45.080
Thank you all for caring so much about Aguri.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.330
Even when I made braised burdock and carrots,

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.130
she'd be sure to leave the carrots untouched!

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.450
It's been quite the problem!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.560
Yeah, uh, no kidding.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.210
Grandmother!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.480
We're here!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.050
Where are we?

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.720
A plantation.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.860
There ya are!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.770
The name's Kadono Aki!

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:13.490
Carrots are the love of my life!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.480
<i>Carrots</i> are?!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.430
Nice to meet you!

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:25.650
And you're the little girl who don't like her carrots?

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.990
... Yes.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:30.060
How's about I show y'all the practice corner?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.640
Practice what?

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.580
How to raise carrots!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.320
Why must I aid my mortal enemy?

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.610
No, not like that!

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:46.010
These carrots are eaten 'round the world, so put'cher back into it!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.190
Around the world? What could you mean?

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:51.930
Mana?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.550
Perfect, keep it up!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:59.030
Show me all the passion y'all can muster!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.520
You too, girls!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:05.690
Very well.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:09.100
Henceforth, I shall spare no effort!

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:17.510
Perfect! Plow with passion!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.470
Next comes the fertilizer!

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:23.940
Fertilizer?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.290
Don't tell me...

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:27.990
It's compost made from manure!

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.950
Manure?!

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.920
No scoops!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.660
Grasp it with your bare hands...

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.860
and spread your warmth to the carrots!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.030
C'mon!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:45.830
She did it!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.100
That's the spirit!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.810
Spread your feelings with that fertilizer!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:57.980
I'm sure Josephina and Marianna are plum happy to feel your love!

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.280
Jose... who?

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.500
She's Josephina.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.250
And she's Marianna.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.490
You name the carrots?!

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:10.890
Buggy buggy!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.360
The bug is eating it!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.340
The vegetables are so yummy that even bugs want to eat them. {Considering how so many of them eat literal shit, I don't think this is an effective message to get across.}

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.560
Yummy!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.510
So, how'd you like working the fields?

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.990
It's as exhausting as I imagined.

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.570
All that work just makes the carrots tastier!

00:10:58.860 --> 00:10:59.780
Want one?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.980
I'll have one!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.250
Yummy!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.450
I know!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:12.010
I want to make nutritious food delicious.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.760
That's what drives me to be a farmer.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.540
It's not just farmers who want to.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:23.520
We chefs feel the same way.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.370
Mari here does too, right?

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.510
Grandmother, too?

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.860
Here, Ai.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.910
Still no dice, huh?

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.180
Huh?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.150
She hates carrots too?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.350
Well, there's an idea.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.350
I hate veggies!

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:50.060
I wanna eat cake!

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:54.710
You won't grow up big and strong if you don't eat your veggies.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.920
Still don't want them?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.640
Well, I wanna grow up big...

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:04.570
Aw, just skip the veggies.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.110
I will grant your desire.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.330
Go berserk!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.370
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:32.170
I friggin' hate veggies!

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.070
What's that?

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.560
A house made of candy?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.750
It's a Selfish!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.310
But that form...

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.970
with its cookie walls and macaroon roof...

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:48.250
are all arranged meticulously to delight the eyes as well as the tongue!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.020
One forgets it's a Selfish!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:52.720
I can only say bravo to its artisan!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.190
Wipe the drool, girl.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.090
Seeelf!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.490
Ecatarina! Rachel!

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.970
Mr. Kakudo!

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:03.230
Grandpa, take Mari somewhere safe!

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:04.260
What about you?

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:05.930
Trust your granddaughter!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.370
Seeeelf!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.510
Stoooooop!

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.340
You're gonna have to go through me!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.550
Self?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.520
Charles!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:23.450
Precure Love Link!

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:24.230
L-O-V-E!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:24.990
L-O-V-E!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:25.630
L-O-V-E!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:26.740
L-O-V-E!

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.670
Precure Dress Up!

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.760
Kyupirappa!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.340
Brimming with love,

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.320
Cure Heart!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.610
The light of wisdom,

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.100
Cure Diamond!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.090
The warmth of the sun,

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:24.470
Cure Rosetta!

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:27.130
The blade of courage,

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:29.140
Cure Sword!

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:34.010
Love's trump card,

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.480
Cure Ace!

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.540
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.250
Dokidoki Precure!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.880
Don't space out, get him!

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.470
Selfish!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.790
Oh poor dessert who has lost his love,

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:02.020
I, Cure Heart,

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:05.580
will make your heart race once more!

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.780
Self, Self...

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.750
Are you all right?

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.430
He fainted while standing?

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.500
He's got guts to try taking on a Selfish!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.480
I understand your feelings.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.680
Now leave the rest to us!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.570
Get 'em, Selfish!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.030
Sweeeeeet!

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:35.280
Sweeeeeet!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.260
Ai!

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.580
Seeeelf...

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.540
Ai!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.710
Eat meeee...

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.600
Carrot... no-no!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.750
Ai is crying!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:10.740
Ai!

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:14.520
Selfy selfy selfy!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.590
It powered up! {Holy shit those are straight up Pokeball sound effects}

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.900
Sword Hurricane!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.350
Ai! Ace!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.780
Are you okay in there?

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.880
Yes, but...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.100
Good! Cry some more!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.830
Selfy selfy selfy!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.170
Heart!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.380
Aw yeah, I can win!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.420
Girls!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.550
So you don't like us, huh?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.480
If you can eat us, just try iiiit.

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:26.100
<i>I want to make nutritious food delicious.</i>

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.580
<i>We chefs feel the same way.</i>

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.230
<i>Mari here does too, right?</i>

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:38.310
You hate us, right?

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:42.810
It's true, I did hate you...

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.290
but I was wrong to do so!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.520
Ai, watch me.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.430
Oh, what now?

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:54.640
You can't eat it.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.380
I learned...

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:59.860
that carrots have people who raise and cook them.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:04.370
They have a limitless amount of love packed into them!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:05.340
Yes!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:07.840
Carrots are crystals of love!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.470
They are not a foe to be feared, but a friend to be loved!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:33.400
This is... the energy of love!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.760
I feel one hundred times as energetic!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.950
Beautify!

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.600
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.470
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.230
Ace Shot!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.630
Bang!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:09.270
Self?

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.000
Ai!

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:19.140
Ace!

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:23.100
Aw, come on!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.580
What the heck?!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.290
Sorry for worrying you.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.030
Girls, let us go!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.350
Yeah!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:35.320
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.580
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:13.190
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:26.400
Love love looooove!

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.940
And I was so close, too!

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.750
Thank goodness!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.390
Eat up.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.680
Yummy!

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:10.030
Why did I spend so long trying to avoid something so delicious?

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.290
Ai too!

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.230
Here, Ai.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.080
It's carrot soup!

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.400
Yummie!

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:29.840
Ai!

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:31.840
Great!

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.520
Gweat!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:04.210
{ED}

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:10.600
Ai's been pretty cranky lately...

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.810
She gets into a bad mood pretty easily.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:13.610
Oh no!

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:16.480
Bel's gang lured Ai out in the middle of the night!

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.690
I suppose it's because we tried to make her sleep during the day.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:23.330
Who in the world takes a baby for a night on the town?

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:26.260
Is it Bel's fault Ai has been so selfish?

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:28.420
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:31.660
Bel's Scheme!

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:31.660
Bel's Scheme!

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:34.080
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
